Cybersecurity Policy (Aligned with NIST 800-53)
1. Access Control (AC-2): Use JWT for authentication; restrict admin to manual updates from trusted HHS emails.
2. Configuration Management (CM-3): Manually review and add HIPAA changes from OCR listserv emails; audit all additions.
3. Data Protection (SC-28): Encrypt notes with AES256.
4. Incident Reporting: Log all changes with django-auditlog; monitor via Wazuh.
5. Policy Enforcement: Use SIEM tools to validate compliance through log analysis.